AM--wcF9I5HQTGFtU1v_hl3TRGCYDYxIOquQsAySKBX4aBJ-bgGSU5Z1z81w05Si1mGYQ\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1roBeXZshRyAPPp1b3GCwViOMbn3jLdlTa0NTSEyB5xgZ1gvAYce8UFLudL5zqKoZRSE_N6W0ERwvUkuQg74W3E\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wrxt1fQFhkSOsY_dhpeJKJf87n3cA-1nPW7QQQ8xKXrnP1-TM5pGX1G7u9GuOtQUge_gaaM53NzkZ7OxVY9X\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uI8qMjik7-PfqhN93fkG8fb1kd9yIp9MNBHuD0uQfkyMylQ51BJFqr69m6wgRfx2j0kuADvBQrNXjruH5EflyjU\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/U5COMo5RWknI4rVCvuTKZJHk5OIfAZnpRDlweGQjV5-CKfpnBbW1KL0mlNMCodfMHJCoFNvovuV7xJ19YGp1\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SKCfNfxAsG-wEr3mnGBNGEdt77HOnGZpU60v2HSpZHaRO8GnhM_rAzx6ar2IxN-4C_sz8j8lPC2-nINPhaz6NQ\"]]],\"Doll Dress Up: Fashion Star\",[\"4,9\",4.862903],\"Phổ thông\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fashion.dress.up\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fashion.dress.up\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fashion.dress.up\"]],[\"qgJhGl8IAEoTCMTt16/HkJcDFQyjbAkdgcgbYPoBDAoKCAASBgoCdmkQAboCNgoaChRjb20uZmFzaGlvbi5kcmVzcy51cBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Doll Dress Up: Fashion Star, the ultimate fashion playground where your creativity knows no bounds! Design, collect, and battle with your dream dolls in a world of endless style possibilities.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ UNLIMITED DRESS UP\\u003cbr\\u003eNo limits, just pure fashion! Customize your dolls from scratch. Select different genders, diverse skin tones, glamorous makeup, and hundreds of clothing concepts. Style without boundaries and build a magnificent collection of unique dolls.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 CHOOSE LEFT OR RIGHT: THE STYLE DUEL!\\u003cbr\\u003ePut your style instincts to the test in our signature fashion battle! Go head-to-head against other players, let the system score your look, and see who claims the title of Style Queen or King!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e• No limits: Total freedom over gender, skin, and makeup 💄\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fun Left or Right decision-making gameplay 💖\\u003cbr\\u003e• A vast collection of styles to unlock and master 👗\\u003cbr\\u003e• Exciting automated scoring system to crown the winner 🏆\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and win the duel!\"],\"CozyTap Studio\",\"10.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VIHqAFmPoTSePQe9WorqXrvh81sfN9-C8pVeyTREqDV2Tk9hjAGkUBQN0tB50L6lh0cYIb8_FfUpO9C9QmnE\"],null,[247,179,235,255]],null,[\"3 tuổi trở lên\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eTìm hiểu thêm\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Phù hợp với tất cả các nhóm tuổi. Một số nội dung bạo lực trong ngữ cảnh hài hước hoặc tưởng tượng có thể được chấp nhận. Không cho phép ngôn từ thô tục.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fashion.dress.up\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fashion.dress.up\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,