03e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 HOW IT WORKS\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Tap the screen. That’s it.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple controls, zero learning curve\\u003cbr\\u003e- Short mini games. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e- Mini \\u0026amp; Classic Games Collection\\u003cbr\\u003e- Calm \\u0026amp; Antistress Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e- Easy to Play, Tricky to Master\\u003cbr\\u003e- Always Fresh Fun\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re bored, stressed, or just scrolling for something fun, Mini Challenges: Calm Games is your go-to chill game collection!\"],\"UltraPub\",\"10.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/db-pe3etYHMkyJp8L5hfsKLeXVq_ILud79Kc2LxSCt1kum1Gbhyahe1mM2pCwL5ba3DvoUoyl2mjqy42_--oIOo\"],null,[237,235,229,255]],null,[\"7 tuổi trở lên\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Bạo lực nhẹ nhàng\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eTìm hiểu thêm\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.u1.relax.minigame3\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.u1.relax.minigame3\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Cài đặt\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Phổ thông\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,nu