ace3d.snowball\"]],[\"qgJvGm0IOUoTCMTt16/HkJcDFQyjbAkdgcgbYPoBDAoKCAASBgoCdmkQAboCRAooCiJjb20uZG9uZ2Jhc2lraS5zbm93cmFjZTNkLnNub3diYWxsEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"❄️ Ice Runner Battle: Snow Race – The Ultimate Ice Racing Challenge!\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you fast enough to survive the most slippery race ever?\\u003cbr\\u003eIce Runner Battle: Snow Race is a fast-paced runner battle game where speed, timing, and strategy decide who reaches the finish line first. Dash across icy tracks, dodge deadly obstacles, and knock your rivals off the course in intense snow races!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOne mistake on the ice… and you’re out of the race.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏃 EASY TO PLAY – HARD TO MASTER\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Swipe to avoid obstacles\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Run, slide, and accelerate on icy roads\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Push opponents and block their path\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Stay ahead and win the snow race\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Simple controls make it easy to start, but only skilled runners can dominate every battle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧊 GAME FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Exciting Snow Races – every level brings new challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️ Battle Runner Gameplay – compete directly against other runners\\u003cbr\\u003e❄️ Icy Tracks \\u0026amp; Snow Maps – slippery roads, traps, and surprises\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Colorful Characters – fun visuals with competitive action\\u003cbr\\u003e📴 Offline Play Supported – enjoy anytime, anywhere\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ Fast \\u0026amp; Casual Gameplay – perfect for short play sessions\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 PERFECT FOR PLAYERS WHO LOVE\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Runner games \\u0026amp; racing games\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Snow race and ice race challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Casual battle games\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Quick, fun, and addictive gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Suitable for all ages, easy to learn but endlessly entertaining.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📲 DOWNLOAD NOW!\\u003cbr\\u003eThe icy battlefield is waiting.\\u003cbr\\u003eWill you outrun everyone… or slip and fall behind?\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Download Ice Runner Battle: Snow Race now and prove you’re the fastest runner on ice!\"],\"Dongbasiki\",\"10.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ox9Y1_QHkgwH_1iHWIe_F3YcL-8B7g7hqnHNphuiV9gc9tOOlHBQAa5JQrze39eoQB9nlXCpINZmIrcZWkTDng\"],null,[233,240,248,255]],null,[\"3 tuổi trở lên\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Mua hàng trong trò chơi\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eTìm hiểu thêm\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.dongbasiki.snowrace3d.snowball\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.dongbasiki.snowrace3d.snowball\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Cài đặt\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Phổ thông\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.mad1.stresscrusher.relaxing.games\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/spUBemSPuuM4jbKi1NsUy_pbTO2Whnaz5q7Aomkfv_UrDw2pEzwyJDxl2Qdd1svsXNPmibS5obt8PUUICO6M\"],null,[108,24,4,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,