sDRc2XOGW3fNmNBIw-I3jM_MvwuL9Wuwu4pOTF8bIlFBamnKB9OA\"]]],\"Paint by Number: Coloring Game\",[\"4,4\",4.39],\"Phổ thông\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.oakever.paintbynumber\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.oakever.paintbynumber\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.oakever.paintbynumber\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIQUoTCMTt16/HkJcDFQyjbAkdgcgbYPoBDAoKCAASBgoCdmkQAboCOwofChljb20ub2FrZXZlci5wYWludGJ5bnVtYmVyEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Paint by Number: Coloring Game (PBN) is an internationally popular coloring and puzzle game that has attracted over 100 million users of all ages. This immersive coloring game serves as a gateway from everyday life into an imaginative world of art expression and color. Each of the 30,000+ coloring pictures is crafted by talented artists worldwide, who passionately create high-quality masterpieces across diverse categories including fantasy, nature, animals, and geometric patterns. This drawing game\\u0026#39;s simple number-guided approach transforms blank canvases into vibrant works of art with beautiful colour, making it the perfect creative escape for anyone seeking both relaxation and artistic fulfillment. 🎉\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLooking to relax with a fun and creative coloring game? Paint by Number offers:\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Diverse Themes: Explore magical worlds, serene landscapes, and intricate patterns while enjoying a unique coloring experience with vibrant colour. ✨\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Artistic Journey: Color fairytale scenes, natural beauty, and mandalas to create stunning pictures full of vibrant color. 🔍\\u003cbr\\u003e★ Mindful Experience: Relax, unwind, and find inner calm through the soothing and therapeutic act of coloring in this engaging drawing game. 🌊\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy choose Paint by Number?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏞️ INSPIRING ARTWORKS 🏞️\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ Premium Resources: PBN collaborates with highly talented, creative artists from around the world who are deeply passionate about their art. Their dedication ensures the coloring pictures in the game is a high-quality colour masterpiece that inspires your creativity and love for drawing game. 📖\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ Diverse Styles: Explore a rich collection of coloring artworks that span various artistic genres, themes, and styles. This drawing game brings together diverse cultural influences and aesthetics to make your coloring journey exciting and unique. Enjoy this drawing game! 🌍\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 UNIQUE COLORING GAMEPLAY 🎨\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ Story-Driven Coloring: Experience a perfect blend of storytelling and coloring as vibrant colors bring characters to life. Dive into the immersive stories, where each stroke of color adds joy while exploring meaningful tales of growth. 🌵\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ Collection Events: Level up your coloring game with fun picture-searching challenges! Unlock exclusive pictures as you color and collect, enjoying the excitement of discovery and the satisfaction of completing your colorful collection. 🖼️\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🖌️ OUTSTANDING USER EXPERIENCE 🖌️\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ Easy Coloring: Effortlessly bring your creations to life with colour. Just tap the screen, and let the vibrant color flow, making amazing art pictures in minutes. 🍁\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ Immersive Experience: Enjoy a relaxing process of coloring, where each stroke of color offers tranquility and engaging colour escape. 🌟\\u003cbr\\u003e☆ User-Friendly Design: Enjoy seamless coloring with a stable, secure app and an intuitive interface designed for every coloring enthusiast. 📱\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBegin your coloring adventure with Paint by Number today! Download now to unlock a world of colour art in this relaxing drawing game. Whether you\\u0026#39;re seeking a moment of calm, creative expression, or simply the joy of color, Paint by Number offers the perfect escape. Join our community of millions of coloring enthusiasts and transform ordinary moments into extraordinary masterpieces. Let your creativity flow and experience the magic of a truly remarkable coloring game! 🎨 💫\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eContact us at support@oakevergames.com\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms: https://oakevergames.com/tos.html\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy: https://oakevergames.com/pp.html\"],\"Oakever Games\",\"5.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wQ7sOlExd0BT0_XEvyqzG1Ipvalld_9nGF7p-J5Mjk7bkYDljCBDalI6CG_NG7RSqyJ7L9oIB4ONOULtA0J9\"],null,[195,196,196,255]],null,[\"3 tuổi trở lên\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eTìm hiểu thêm\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Phù hợp với tất cả các nhóm tuổi. Một số nội dung bạo lực trong ngữ cảnh hài hước hoặc tưởng tượng có thể được chấp nhận. Không cho phép ngôn từ thô tục.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.oakever.paintbynumber\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.oakever.paintbynumber\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Cài đặt\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"131.000 ₫ - 1.850.000 ₫ mỗi mặt hàng\",[false]]],