u003e👗 Runway Showdowns:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Strut your stuff on the runway and impress the judges!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Compete in themed fashion challenges to win exclusive rewards\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to Slay the Runway? Download Fashion Impress now and start your journey to become the ultimate fashion icon!\"],\"UltraPub\",\"10.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dZsYQkERMpVJfZT0-3_2EZOeehFQ56_SeqhBd7EZewxo2T_NhDgnJo-6Zb4KZad8BEJya6s9vieb1RkV0eHdcQ\"],null,[177,155,132,255]],null,[\"3 tuổi trở lên\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eTìm hiểu thêm\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Phù hợp với tất cả các nhóm tuổi. Một số nội dung bạo lực trong ngữ cảnh hài hước hoặc tưởng tượng có thể được chấp nhận. Không cho phép ngôn từ thô tục.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.grus.dress.room.doll.fashion\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.grus.dress.room.doll.fashion\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Cài đặt\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"23.000 ₫ - 150.000 ₫ mỗi mặt hàng\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Phổ thông\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],