[[null,null,\"ZZrY6OTwusA\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:ZZrY6OTwusA?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:ZZrY6OTwusA\",null,[1280,720],null,null,\"AXH1ezkFY4uZzkr9jqpiowgcYJPhpiRGVYTjkZxbQNwt4-UNV248nrF9mxaIc7uF7EHZzdb4jFKlK5vdvNIuEEIL2S--ry_hgPSgcyvFLdODPRVUvbaFmnjdCldIgRPwPSXokTZhzNqiAmJDTSiihw69Gy7rJgl7IjK-LjCmWeaszlCzB_KbPo6Uf-hCaJoMbA8lVjn3yS9dnyfFe65uEaZFS0jPQVROfWP6JAu1RJFpjkcuc72qoGfgnHBraKM1mqsHLY4kNpnBD0pEqRfECntXzslC8gV8-28dO6d5jeLaaOgFzg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZZrY6OTwusA/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"What game do you want to play? I have everything here.\\u003cbr\\u003eOf course, you can also play with friends!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBut if you want to play with your friends on the same device, this game is a great choice!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you don\\u0026#39;t have friends to play multiplayer on a single device, play against the AI alone!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKlutz:\\u003cbr\\u003eRun as far as you can before the countdown ends!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFootball battle:\\u003cbr\\u003eWho has the football skills to score a goal in a one-click football match?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePing-Pong:\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenge your friends by moving the paddle with your fingers!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRacing drift:\\u003cbr\\u003eGet to the finish line as fast as you can.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe king of SUMO\\u003cbr\\u003eBeat your opponent in the sumo arena. Don\\u0026#39;t get pushed on the line!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTic-tac-toe:\\u003cbr\\u003eNo need to use pen and paper, just challenge your friends on screen! A classic two-player game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTank battle:\\u003cbr\\u003eFight each other on the battlefield. Who is the best scorer?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpinning top:\\u003cbr\\u003ePush your opponent off the stage! Two players in a small area is too many!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHockey ball:\\u003cbr\\u003eMove the paddle with your finger and score to get the puck into your friend\\u0026#39;s goal!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCats Catch Fish:\\u003cbr\\u003eTest your pacing skills and be the first to catch 3 goldfish!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhack a Mole:\\u003cbr\\u003eMaster the rhythm of the gopher\\u0026#39;s burrow and be the first to hit 5 gophers!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJumping Bird:\\u003cbr\\u003eSee the position of the obstacle in front of you and use the rise or fall to avoid it\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAnd more! (e.g., mini golf, Hippo, Curling，puzzle，Frog…)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis two-player game collection features nice minimal graphics that let you focus on dueling with your opponent and save time between matches and let the challenge continue between mini-games!\\u003cbr\\u003eUnleash the power of multiplayer and bring fun to the party!\"],\"SUPERIOR  STUDIO\",\"10.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qBpCzDG6KEFLnLUnpw613aaZynDpvUWO1vmDKCj_ufgVRbVraBkVqYuhq2LJCM9ZHv7YXQiJ5cqyH7s8w_RAyTk\"],null,[234,25,36,255]],null,[\"3 tuổi trở lên\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eTìm hiểu thêm\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Phù hợp với tất cả các nhóm tuổi. Một số nội dung bạo lực trong ngữ cảnh hài hước hoặc tưởng tượng có thể được chấp nhận. Không cho phép ngôn từ thô tục.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"VN