--yeNEpxD1pqlVlVhNtOm2yooCkYtr1nYUvYB7NkAb1FeUWo0mB46elYaGXbfAuRwuGnAsTEy0GNA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cvB3QPbTLoqDWGj5f19G0HX2mX8IGraZtTJSXI0sG3qPeG9VgakfoXqKntUt_lUCUtdhIvCEJAMqSj1D0Pusow\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/axzseYQY39ZttfVXRSsWblyZ5jQKxTu84yUjfliGsgURo0gcYv5CeOuNzMNMrksSRVL4A180kUX-D6zT5j-IWA\"]]],\"Momo Dress up game\",[\"4,0\",4.029703],\"Phổ thông\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.rumi.dressup\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.rumi.dressup\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.rumi.dressup\"]],[\"qgJoGmYIU0oTCMTt16/HkJcDFQyjbAkdgcgbYPoBFwoVCOGcy4O23/6MQxIJCgVlbi1VUxAAugIyChYKEGNvbS5ydW1pLmRyZXNzdXAQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🌈 Welcome to 《Momo Dress up game》—we’ve made the BEST fashion makeover stage just for YOU! 🌈 Here, fashion design, trendy outfits, cosplay—let your creativity go CRAZY with everything! Princess dreams, fashion star wishes, even a Barbi world adventure—they all come true super easily~ Dive into the fun of fashion dress up games and turn your fashion fantasy into something real! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💡 Dress Up\\u0026amp;Make up DIY\\u003cbr\\u003eWe’re talking over 20 dress-up spots and 600+ awesome pieces to play with!you can style your paper doll however you want!Pick cute outfits, design pretty facial features, and rock sweet hairstyles—don’t forget the tiny, fancy accessories that make the look pop! Whether you’re going for a sweet girl vibe, a lovely pocket girl, or even cosplay as your favorite anime character,the choice is yours—let’s get these dolls into fashion dress up right now!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨Build Your Avatar into a True Superstar\\u003cbr\\u003eA brand-new little life has just popped into the world—and she’s got endless awesome choices ahead! What path will you pick for her? Every decision you make shapes her whole journey—pick wisely to help her grow exactly how you want!Will she become a magic girl with awesome powers? Or a glittery fashion star ruling the fashion games? It’s all up to you—let’s guide her to shine bright in her own amazing way!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📱 Live Stream Your Awesome Style!\\u003cbr\\u003eGot a killer makeover or a totally unique outfit idea? Now you can start live streams anytime, anywhere—no waiting required! Show off your one-of-a-kind makeup and fashion vibes, share all your funtricks with viewers, and collect cool gifts from your fans!Want to become the most popular live stream star around? Keep bringing your creative energy, flaunt your favorite styles, and watch your hype grow! Whether you’re rocking a magic princess look or a trendy fashion fit, your livestream is your chance to shine—let’s make you a super live sensation\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Fashion Battle Dress Up Game\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the super hype PK battle with friends—how cool is that! Create awesome outfits for your idol, then show off your realfashion stylist skills!Want to level up the fun? Start a totally cool dance crew and build a famous group! Let your avatar paper dolls shine together on stage—every fashion showdown is your big chance to be the sparkly fashion queen! You’ll glow bright for sure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 More Than Just Dress Up\\u003cbr\\u003eSo many surprises are waiting for you! Unlock hidden easter eggs to get exclusive doll dress and makeup sets.Open surprise egg for extra fun rewards too! This game has girl games makeup stuff, barbie games vibes, and sparkly princess dress up options—just like IMVU’s cool customization mixed with classic girls dress up fun. It’s the perfect dress up games free treat for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀 Download NOW and start your fashion star journey! Dress up, take over the fashion world, and turn your paper princess dreams into real fun. Your fashion adventure starts RIGHT NOW—don’t miss it! It’s the best free girl games pick for all your style fun!\"],\"Kitten Doll Studio\",\"1.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iQPWwDIQGfN4vVGBiFAp4Dvnv_Ys02XCa_AQbyCa5hVQbdF-k1p_pprRmsFPjBWfmFz8IGqr0kEo4vP2IYdUlB0\"],null,[236,233,233,255]],null,[\"3 tuổi trở lên\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eTìm hiểu thêm\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Phù hợp với tất cả các nhóm tuổi. Một số nội dung bạo lực trong ngữ cảnh hài hước hoặc tưởng tượng có thể được chấp nhận. Không cho phép ngôn từ thô tục.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.rumi.dressup\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.rumi.dressup\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Cài đặt\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"52.000 ₫ - 182.000 ₫ mỗi mặt hàng\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Phổ thông\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"co