/z3uCBIFcMUPTyHFZdDABJo8mbm2kGJToIYA4_vx60yA4H87F6ORfhLqycqb51GXCT-10Rh7kA9VucFoH1lO1WA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zw4bOcuVsudr345B5kz3q1WOkhOvqDfBOT_6Y0To9FsyWDRqw1iwIw9iTwVza1_n3ZFVZHaYZ3waKWzmAyB77A\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cXte6J4K0Bra19a4LrTxLGjcLFdzUnOyRlGQ9ravER6BPfQD1o1yqvXI34Sa5kbRZIFtzA0Uc2esMBzq9mIBxw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UAegNUt_IIm8gMq1q3T_Y7ueNd1Rj9eSjWW6vrlGp3-MZGdZO8HyVV1sBU8PPcFUkS48WqHg3IJqp3OcHvLTog\"]]],\"Home Decor ASMR: Makeover Game\",[\"3,7\",3.6833334],\"Phổ thông\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.cozy.decor.dream.room.unpacking\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.cozy.decor.dream.room.unpacking\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.cozy.decor.dream.room.unpacking\"]],[\"qgJwGm4IW0oTCMTt16/HkJcDFQyjbAkdgcgbYPoBDAoKCAASBgoCdmkQAboCRQopCiNjb20uY296eS5kZWNvci5kcmVhbS5yb29tLnVucGFja2luZxABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🌈 Welcome to Home Decor ASMR: Makeover Game, a satisfying games designed to relax your mind and refresh your spirit. Dive into a world of ASMR,  where every tap, every item, and every corner of your room feels calming, satisfying, and beautifully rewarding.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📦Unpack, organize, decorate and solve puzzles. Let the soft clicks, gentle slides, and calming tones guide you as you turn messy rooms into perfectly cozy dream spaces designed by you. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIt\\u0026#39;s a simple, fun, and relaxing game for anyone seeking a calming experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌿  Key Features\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ ASMR Unpacking \\u0026amp; Organizing\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy soothing sounds as you open boxes, sort items, and place everything exactly where it belongs. Every action is crafted to feel calming and satisfying.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Satisfying Room Makeovers\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTransform bedrooms, studios, living rooms and more. Choose decorations, place furniture, and create your perfect cozy home\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐Relaxing No-Rush Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThere are no timers, no pressure. Just peaceful design moments that help your mind unwind.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Cute Items to Unbox\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover adorable lamps, plants, plushies, stationery, shelves, art pieces, and many more delightful items. Stylish decor to create a space that feels uniquely yours.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Relaxing Puzzle Gameplay: Enjoy calming, no-pressure puzzles where every piece fits perfectly and every placement feels just right.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Unique Gameplay: It’s unlike anything else—simple, intuitive, and endlessly charming\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 How to Play 🎮\\u003cbr\\u003e1️⃣Unpack boxes adorable items\\u003cbr\\u003e2️⃣ Organize and place each item in the perfect spot,tidy up everything\\u003cbr\\u003e3️⃣Decorate your dreamy room\\u003cbr\\u003e4️⃣Complete rooms to unlock new cozy spaces to makeover 🎁\\u003cbr\\u003e5️⃣Enjoy soft ASMR sounds and relax with satisfying puzzles 🧩\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💖 Why You’ll Love It?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Soft, soothing ASMR audio\\u003cbr\\u003e• Extremely satisfying unpacking \\u0026amp; sorting\\u003cbr\\u003e• Tons of cute decor items\\u003cbr\\u003e• Calming makeover puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003e• Cozy visuals for stress-free play\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Ready to relax?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLet gentle ASMR guide you through a peaceful decorating journey. Unbox charming items, organize calming spaces, and build the cozy dream home you’ve always imagined.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎀 Download Home Decor ASMR: Makeover Game now and start designing your perfect cozy world! 🏡💗\"],\"CAT Studio\",\"100.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/p5F9qYIP4EPNuqy1tR112Z0hZ3Ime743e6vpa7xW76Bx6baHlcr7sPcZ_fstBVLabDSAVqyMmDaSkz2GIm0dlvk\"],null,[238,187,198,255]],null,[\"3 tuổi trở lên\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eTìm hiểu thêm\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Phù hợp với tất cả các nhóm tuổi. Một số nội dung bạo lực trong ngữ cảnh hài hước hoặc tưởng tượng có thể được chấp nhận. Không cho phép ngôn từ thô tục.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.cozy.decor.dream.room.unpacking\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.cozy.decor.dream.room.unpacking\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Cài đặt\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"65.000 ₫ - 369.000 ₫ mỗi mặt hàng\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Phổ thông\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.surprise.toy.d3\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleuserc