AF5iRwIzI6Egnj_F_bpY\"]]],\"Super Toy 3D\",[\"4,0\",4.0456905],\"Phổ thông\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.surprise.toy.d3\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.surprise.toy.d3\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.surprise.toy.d3\"]],[\"qgJgGl4IXEoTCMTt16/HkJcDFQyjbAkdgcgbYPoBDAoKCAASBgoCdmkQAboCNQoZChNjb20uc3VycHJpc2UudG95LmQzEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"RHYmzsTZI0g\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:RHYmzsTZI0g?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:RHYmzsTZI0g\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkYu_QBbc-qfXWuaqQpulQfAAAR9q_n8HGBvKElmQfudR_LdK9Wq9ScXIYnP92AWRqaht4ofwfQwT2tJUga1wRRWlHS3OIxAU7rqrkLFyrIE3IcK7HRCv_1IgaF_hJFpvg_LFd8sHD_92xWeyEZfNVWm77IZyCix_FB0zy7uXhGR8T2lJ_K14zqJmB4yjJigovIVX3wU6PSwYFUE9FS1O2G9dmiVGFkICm2ZvQ1zdZOYKptRkP_Y6i3h1deXIbC27NG11xEaCNzecq_AhNua8M7GT3l_Ybm4rWiFBeVpIXj6Q\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RHYmzsTZI0g/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eCAN YOU CRACK THE PUZZLES?\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLooking for a fun and relaxing casual puzzle game that’s guaranteed to please your inner child whatever age you are? Super Toy 3D is a model construction simulator that brings the excitement of unwrapping and assembling novelty toys to life on your mobile device, with cute and funny surprises, hugely satisfying game mechanics and egg-ceptional antistress properties. Peel off the wrapping, crack the chocolate egg, and find out what’s inside the yolk in this awesome and original relaxing game that recreates one of everybody’s favorite childhood treats.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🥚HOURS OF EGG-CITEMENT 🥚\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🐣Get cracking: \\u003c/b\\u003eSuper Toy 3D is a simulator that recreates every stage of the toy surprise experience. First you unwrap the foil, then you need to break open the chocolate egg. Inside, you’ll find a yolk container. Pop it open to discover what your surprise is this time, then assemble the toy, decorate it with stickers 🤩, and mount it on the shelf with the rest of your collection.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🐣In-eggs-haustible variety: \\u003c/b\\u003eThe mechanics of the game may be simple, but Super Toy 3D never gets boring, with over 20 different themed toy collections comprising a total of over 100 unique toys for construction, each with six stickers to decorate it.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🐣Highly coll-egg-tible: \\u003c/b\\u003eThe themed collections of toy surprises include monsters, superheroes, spirits, and much more, all packed with cute pop culture references and funny toy designs that you’ll love assembling and decorating with stickers.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🐣Funny yokes:\\u003c/b\\u003e Furthermore, each collection has its own unique themed packaging, chocolate egg form, yolk container, and unwrapping method – hack away at the foil with an axe or peel it smoothly with a samurai sword, then melt the chocolate with a thunderstorm or chip away at it with darting frogs’ tongues. You’ll soon discover, the surprise isn’t just inside.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e🐣Sunny side up: \\u003c/b\\u003eWith bright, welcoming graphics, adorable designs, and simple but satisfying mechanics, Super Toy 3D is a great antistress experience that can really help with relaxing, combining the fun of surprises with the satisfaction of assembling models and building a collection.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eBETTER THAN 🍫CHOCOLATE\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCraving a delicious distraction or a new hit of stress-relieving dopamine? If your brains are scrambled and your concentration is fried, Super Toy 3D is here to bring you simple, relaxing puzzle fun that will soothe your mind and delight your senses. Download the game now and escape into a world of simple but hugely satisfying pleasures 😍.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://say.games/privacy-policy\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: https://say.games/terms-of-use\"],\"SayGames Ltd\",\"50.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YErP6ix8-ZkA5XTY3pk7IubJuMMa5o8AKeYT7AoEkq4eEGX568kdJswL7Q7i1Y68uKRmNTQIDKQ0q3dFy20gpA\"],null,[255,178,1,255]],null,[\"3 tuổi trở lên\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eTìm hiểu thêm\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Phù hợp với tất cả các nhóm tuổi. Một số nội dung bạo lực trong ngữ cảnh hài hước hoặc tưởng tượng có thể được chấp nhận. Không cho phép ngôn từ thô tục.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"VND\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Mua\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.surprise.toy.d3\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.surprise.toy.d3\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Cài đặt\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"100.000 ₫ mỗi mặt hàng\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Phổ thông\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,n